EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
       There are several packages which provide a text editor compatible with
       vvii, for example nnvvii and vviimm. Which one is used is controlled by the
       link group vvii, which includes links for the program itself and the
       associated manpage.

       To display the available packages which provide vvii and the current
       setting for it, use the ----ddiissppllaayy action:

        update-alternatives --display vi

       To choose a particular vvii implementation, use this command as root and
       then select a number from the list:

        update-alternatives --config vi

       To go back to having the vvii implementation chosen automatically, do
       this as root:

        update-alternatives --auto vi

